                "text": "[visible] Mahindra XUV 3XO Price - Images, Colours & Reviews - CarWale\nNEW CARS\nUSED CARS\nREVIEWS & NEWS\nAD\nMahindra XUV 3XO\n3.9\nExpert Rating\n|\n4.6\nUser Rating (553)\nRate & Win\nThe Mahindra XUV 3XO offers a sorted ride and engaging drive, ample space, and modern-day equipment. While its boot space is limited, it isn't a deal-breaker, especially considering the compact SUVs attractive pricing. It is available with both petrol and diesel power.\nOverview\n360 View\nVariants\nOffers\nSimilar Cars\nColours\nBrochure\nMileage\nUser Reviews\nNews\nExpert Reviews\nVideos\nImages\nFAQs\nColours\nImages\nView\nVariant\nSelect Variant\nCity\nShow price in my city\nRs.  7.99 - 15.80 Lakh\nXUV 3XO On Road Price\nEx-Showroom price, Mumbai\nCalculate your EMI\nEMI Calculator\nGet July Offers\n4 Things to Know About XUV 3XO\nHas projector headlamps, 17-inch alloys and a 360-degree camera.\nThe instrument cluster is fully digital with customisable screens.\nTop-spec versions get dual-zone climate control with rear AC vents.\nOne of the USPs of the Mahindra XUV 3XO is level-2 ADAS\nMahindra XUV 3XO Price\nMahindra XUV 3XO price for the base model starts at Rs. 7.99 Lakh and the top model price goes upto Rs. 15.80 Lakh (Avg. ex-showroom). XUV 3XO price for 29 variants is listed below.\nFilter By Fuel type & Transmission\nPetrol\nDiesel\nManual\nAutomatic (TC)\nAutomatic (AMT)\nVariants\nEx-Showroom price\nCompare\nXUV 3XO MX1 1.2 Petrol\n1197 cc, Petrol, Manual, 18.89 kmpl, 110 bhp\nRs. 7.99 Lakh\nCompare\nView Price Breakup\nGet Offers\nJust Launched\nXUV 3XO REVX M 1.2 Petrol\n1197 cc, Petrol, Manual, 110 bhp\nRs. 8.94 Lakh\nCompare\nView Price Breakup\nGet Offers\nJust Launched\nXUV 3XO REVX M (O)1.2 Petrol\n1197 cc, Petrol, Manual, 110 bhp\nRs. 9.44 Lakh\nCompare\nView Price Breakup\nGet Offers\nXUV 3XO MX2 Pro 1.2 Petrol\n1197 cc, Petrol, Manual, 18.89 kmpl, 110 bhp\nRs. 9.54 Lakh\nCompare\nView Price Breakup\nGet Offers\nXUV 3XO MX3 1.2 Pet