t Rs. 8.94 lakh, ex-showroom.\n8 Jul 2025\nHow is the Mahindra XUV 3XO car?\nPros\nThe diesel engine offers excellent pulling power.\nIt's available with automatic gearboxes on all engines.\nGets level-2 ADAS and lots of new-age features.\nIs offered with six airbags as standard fitment on all variants.\nCons\nIts exterior design does not appeal to everybody.\nThe light interior can be challenging to maintain.\nThe feel-good features are primarily in the top-end variants.\nXUV 3XO Engine Specifications\n4.0\nExpert Rating\n|\n4.7\nUser Rating (553)\nPetrol 1197cc Turbo\nDiesel 1497cc Turbo\nUnder the hood, the XUV 3XO is powered by the same 1.2-litre turbo-petrol and TGDi turbo-petrol engines.\nA six-speed manual transmission is standard, while a new six-speed torque converter automatic gearbox is available in the TGDi guise..\nMahindra XUV 3XO Key Specifications:\nFuel Type\nPetrol\nEngine\n1197 cc Turbocharged\nTransmission\nManual & Automatic (TC)\nMileage (ARAI)\n17.96 to 20.1 kmpl\nPower\n110 & 129 bhp\nTorque\n200 & 230 Nm\nRead More\nThere is also 1.5-litre diesel mill on offer.\nThe transmission options for this version include six-speed manual and AMT units.\nKey Specifications:\nFuel Type\nDiesel\nEngine\n1497 cc Turbocharged\nTransmission\nManual & Automatic (AMT)\nMileage (ARAI)\n20.6 to 21.2 kmpl\nPower\n115 bhp\nTorque\n300 Nm\nRead More\nXUV 3XO Convenience and Technology\n3.9\nExpert Rating\n|\n4.6\nUser Rating (553)\nInside, the sub-four-metre SUV comes equipped with notable features, including a panoramic sunroof and Level 2 ADAS suite.\nIt also features dual-zone climate control, two 10.25-inch screens, rear AC vents, EPB with auto-hold function, 360-degree camera, and a cooled glove box.\nRead More\nAd\nPolicy Bazaar new car insurance benefits:\nSave up to 91%\non\nCar Insurance\nPremiums.\nCompare 40+\ninsurers to get the\nbest deal for you!\nQuick,\npaperless\njourney\n- fully digital\nprocess.\nExpert guidance\nat\nevery step of your\npurchase