          "text": "[visible] Mahindra XUV 3XO: Price, Specifications, Images\nSkip to content\nHOME\nNEWS\nRULES & REGULATIONS\nBEST CARS\nBUYING A CAR\nGUIDES\nCAR COMPARISONS\nCAR REVIEWS\nLOANS\nDOCUMENTS\nCAR OWNERSHIP\nCAR CARE\nINSURANCE\nSELL YOUR CAR\nBUY ASSURED CARS\nUsed Cars in Delhi NCR\nUsed Cars in Delhi\nUsed Cars in Gurgaon\nUsed Cars in Noida\nUsed Cars in Bangalore\nUsed Cars in Hyderabad\nUsed Cars in Mumbai\nUsed Cars in Pune\nUsed Cars in Chennai\nUsed Cars in Ahmedabad\nUsed Cars in Kolkata\nSpinny Car Hubs\nSearch\nNEWS\nBEST CARS\nBUYING A CAR\nCAR OWNERSHIP\nSELLING A CAR\nRULES & REGULATIONS\nNEWS\nBEST CARS\nBUYING A CAR\nCAR OWNERSHIP\nSELLING A CAR\nRULES & REGULATIONS\nHome\n\nBUYING A CAR\nMahindra XUV 3XO: Price, Specifications, Images\nExplore the Mahindra XUV 3XO, a feature-rich subcompact SUV with bold styling, 6 airbags, and a 5-star Bharat NCAP rating. This guide covers XUV 3XO price, specifications, safety features, and city-wise on-road pricing. Learn why it's a smart choice for families seeking a stylish, safe, and powerful urban SUV.\nTeam Spinny\nLast updated 3 months ago\nThe Mahindra XUV 3XO is the refreshed version of the immensely popular XUV300, marking the brands strong presence in this highly competitive sub-compact SUV segment. Known for its bold exterior design and premium interior with a large cabin, the XUV 3XO is the perfect combination of style, comfort, and functionality. With the legacy of Mahindra for quality and good sales, it is continuing to gain momentum among urban families and adventure lovers.\nThe 3XO also offers some amazing safety features and a fresh design, making it one of the class leaders in the subcompact SUV category. Its robust engineering and premium comfort make it unique among its competitors. Moreover, with a 5-star safety rating in the Bharat NCAP crash tests, the XUV 3XO promises to be a safe and agile car for families every time they drive it.\nMahindra XUV 3XO Overview\nThe Mahindra XUV 3XO charms with its aggressive looks, rich interiors, and big cabin space and sets a perfect blend of beauty and comfort with utilitarian value. The sharp LED headlamps, sleek grille, and muscular stance ensure it makes a strong first impression. Inside, the SUV provides a luxurious cabin with exclusive materials, ergonomic seating, and top-notch options for infotainment, assuring an immersive experience for occupants.\nThe XUV 3XO has a host of safety features, such as hill-start assist, electronic stability control, and up to six airbags to ensure driver and passenger safety. Its smooth driving dynamics, excellent manoeuvrability, and strong suspension system ensure a comfortable ride on city roads and rugged terrains. The XUV 3XO comes in various variants, like petrol and diesel, and automatic and manual transmissions to fit the bill for a wide range of customers.\nMahindra XUV 3XO Specifications\nThe XUV 3XO boasts of its unique design and the highest possible ratings for crash safety. Besides safety, here are the key Mahindra XUV 3XO Specifications:\nMahindra XUV 3XO Specifications\nEngine\n1.2L MPFi Turbo Petrol\n1.2L TGDi Turbo Petrol\n1.5L Diesel\nTransmission\n6-Speed Manual6-speed TC Automatic\n6-Speed ManualAMT Automatic\nPower\n110 PS\n130 PS\n117 PS\nTorque\n200 Nm\n230 Nm\n300 Nm\nMileage\n17.96 km/l\n18.20 km/l\n21.2 km/l\nAirbags\n6 Airbags as standard\nMahindra XUV 3XO Dimensions\nLength\n3990 mm\nWidth\n1821 mm\nHeight\n1647 mm\nWheelbase\n2600 mm\nBoot Space\n295 litres\nMahindra XUV 3XO Safety Features\nAirbags\n6 Standard\nABS with EBD\nStandard\nRear Parking Sensors\nStandard\nAll Wheel Disc Brakes\nStandard\nReverse Parking Camera\nHigher Variants\nElectronic Stability Programme\nStandard\nTyre Pressure Monitoring System\nHigher Variants\nISOFIX Mounts\nStandard\nHill Hold Assist\nStandard\nHill Descent Control\nStandard\nMahindra XUV 3XO Feature Highlights\nDual-Zone Automatic Climate Control\nAX5 and above\nSunroof\nAX7 and above\nFront Parking Sensors\nStandard\nMahindra XUV 3XO Price\nThe Mahindra XUV 3XO price offers great value for money, catering to various budgets. The price for the petrol variant of Mahindra XUV3XO starts at Rs. 7.99 lakh (ex-showroom) for the base MX1 model, and the diesel lineup begins at Rs. 9.90 lakh (ex-showroom). The top-end AX7L variant is priced at Rs. 15.56 lakh (ex-showroom), making it quite an all-rounded offering for buyers seeking premium features and safety. The price structure ensures a model to suit everyones needs, from budget-conscious buyers to those seeking a feature-packed SUV.\nMahindra XUV 3XO Price (ex-showroom)\nVariant\nPowertrain\nPrice\nXUV 3XO MX1\nPetrol\nRs. 7.99 lakh\nXUV 3XO MX2\nDiesel\nRs. 9.99 lakh\nXUV 3XO MX2 Pro\nPetrol\nRs. 9.39  10.39 lakh\nDiesel\nRs. 10.49 lakh\nXUV 3XO MX3\nPetrol\nRs. 9.74  11.40 lakh\nDiesel\nRs. 10.99  11.79 lakh\nXUV 3XO MX3 Pro\nPetrol\nRs. 9.99  11.69 lakh\nDiesel\nRs. 11.39 lakh\nXUV 3XO AX5\nPetrol\nRs. 11.19  12.69 lakh\nDiesel\nRs. 12.19  12.99 lakh\nXUV 3XO AX5 L\nPetrol\nRs. 12.44  13.94 lakh\nXUV 3XO AX7\nPetrol\nRs. 12.56 -13.99 lakh\nDiesel\nRs. 13.69  14.49 lakh\nXUV 3XO AX7 L\nPetrol\nRs. 13.99  15.56 lakh\nDiesel\nRs. 14.99 lakh\nMahindra XUV 3XO On-Road Price\nHeres a breakdown of the Mahindra XUV 3XO on-road in major cities in India:\nCity\nOn-Road Price\nDelhi\nRs. 8.97  18.20 lakh\nBangalore\nRs. 9.53  19.07 lakh\nHyderabad\nRs. 9.53  19.07 lakh\nMumbai\nRs. 9.35  18.37 lakh\nPune\nRs. 9.29  18.29 lakh\nAhmedabad\nRs. 9.07  17.68 lakh\nChennai\nRs. 9.65  19.52 lakh\nKolkata\nRs. 8.67  16.90 lakh\nLucknow\nRs. 9.04  17.96 lakh\nJaipur\nRs. 9.24  18.12 lakh\nChandigarh\nRs. 9.20  18.27 lakh\nCoimbatore\nRs. 9.44  19.21 lakh\nFaridabad\nRs. 9.04  17.65 lakh\nGhaziabad\nRs. 9.04  17.96 lakh\nIndore\nRs. 9.04  17.96 lakh\nKochi\nRs. 9.44  19.05 lakh\nSecond Hand Mahindra XUV 3XO Price\nThe second-hand car market offers many attractive options for budget-conscious buyers. Spinny offers used Mahindra XUV 3XO models with detailed inspections and comprehensive warranties. The price for a used Mahindra XUV 3XO depends on the model year, distance driven, variant, and mileage. Buying a secondhand XUV 3XO is an easy way to enjoy this feature-laden SUV at more affordable prices.\nUsed Mahindra XUV 3XO Price on Spinny\nSpinny is a trusted platform for second-hand car buyers and here is a list of XUV 3XO pricing across major cities:\nUsed Mahindra XUV 3XO price on Spinny\nCity\nUsed Car Price\nPune\nRs. 12 lakh onwards\nKolkata\nRs. 13 lakh onwards\nMahindra XUV 3XO Images\nMahindra XUV 3XO Exterior Images\nMahindra XUV 3XO Interior Images\nFAQs about Mahindra XUV 3XO\nQ. What is the price of XUV 3XO?\nThe Mahindra XUV 3XOs ex-showroom price starts at Rs. 7.79 lakh for the base model and goes up to Rs. 15.49 lakh for the top-end variant.\nQ. Is XUV 3XO 5-seater or 7-seater?\nThe Mahindra XUV 3XO is a 5-seater SUV that offers ample space and comfort for both front and rear passengers.\nQ. Is Mahindra XUV 3XO worth buying?\nYes, the XUV 3XO is worth buying due to its premium features, excellent safety ratings, spacious interiors, and a choice of powerful yet fuel-efficient engines. Its a complete package for small families and urban buyers.\nQ. Is Mahindra XUV 3XO launched in India?\nYes, the Mahindra XUV 3XO was officially launched in India on April 29, 2024.\nQ. Which XUV 3XO has a sunroof?\nThe sunroof option is available in several variants of the Mahindra XUV 3XO, including MX2 Pro 1.2 Petrol, MX3 1.2 Petrol, AX5 1.5 Diesel, AX7L 1.2 Petrol, and more. Sunroof availability varies depending on the specific variant and engine configuration.\nShare\nLeave a Comment\nCancel Reply\nYour email address will not be published.\nRequired fields are marked\n*\nType here..\nName*\nE-mail*\nWebsite\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment.\n\nUse Vehicle Transfer Form to Transfer Vehicle Ownership in Bangalore\nBest Used Jeep Cars\nJeep Compass Real World Mileage\nBest Used Volkswagen Cars in India: Top Picks and Buyer Tips\nUse Vehicle Transfer Form to Transfer Vehicle Ownership in Bangalore\nMarch 12, 2025\nBest Used Jeep Cars\nJuly 11, 2025\nJeep Compass Real World Mileage\nJuly 11, 2025\nBest Used Volkswagen",
