      "audit_report": "This step generates CSS styles for the Mahindra XUV 3XO analysis report. The CSS will style the container, headings, paragraphs, tables, and other elements to improve readability and visual appeal. The code uses the content from the previously generated HTML file and writes the CSS to a file named `styles.css`. The code adheres to the formatting and string handling rules. The result is stored in the `layout_css_4A` variable.",
